---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta"><a href="/">← Back home</a></p>

  <h2>what we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>nothing.</strong></p>
  <p>beadster is a local-only app. everything stays on your Mac.</p>

  <h2>where your data lives</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>all issue data stored in <code>.beads</code> folders inside your projects.</li>
    <li>no cloud sync in this version.</li>
    <li>no data sent to our servers.</li>
    <li>no analytics.</li>
    <li>no tracking.</li>
    <li>no telemetry.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>your data, your control</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>you own all your issue data.</li>
    <li>stored entirely on your Mac.</li>
    <li>deleted when you remove projects or delete the app.</li>
    <li>no backups on our servers because we never see your data.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>permissions</h2>
  <p>the app requests permission to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access folders you explicitly select (macOS file picker).</li>
    <li>read and write <code>.beads</code> folders in those projects.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>that's it. nothing else.</p>

  <h2>no account required</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>no sign up.</li>
    <li>no email.</li>
    <li>no password.</li>
    <li>no user profile.</li>
    <li>100% offline.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>future versions</h2>
  <p>future versions may offer optional cloud sync. if we do:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>it will be opt-in only.</li>
    <li>this policy will be updated.</li>
    <li>you'll be notified before any data leaves your Mac.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>changes</h2>
  <p>we may update this policy. major changes will be posted here.</p>

  <h2>contact</h2>
  <p>questions: <a href="mailto:hi@beadster.ai">hi@beadster.ai</a></p>
  <p>operated by: System Operator LLC, Delaware, USA.</p>
</Layout>
